diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 2407308..80bf61a 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -4,6 +4,22 @@ All notable changes to Zoteus are documented here. The format is based on
 [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) and this project adheres to
 [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Fixed
+- **`mode:"semantic"` no longer answers "No matches" when nothing can embed the query.**
+  Semantic ranking needs both ends of the comparison — vectors in the index, and an
+  embedder to turn the query into one — but the refusal only tested the first. An index
+  built with an embedder and reopened with `ZOTEUS_EMBEDDINGS=off` keeps its vectors (they
+  are unusable, not known-wrong), so `hasVectors` stayed true, the refusal did not fire,
+  and the query fell through to a ranker with no query vector and a keyword ranker closed
+  by `mode:"semantic"`. The result was a bare `No matches for "…"`, indistinguishable from
+  a library that genuinely holds nothing on the subject; `embedderNotice` is deliberately
+  silent about a provider switched off on purpose, so nothing else explained it either.
+  Semantic mode now refuses whenever there is no embedder, names which of the two halves
+  is missing, and points at `mode:"keyword"`. `auto` and `keyword` are unaffected, and a
+  provider that fails mid-query still reports itself through the existing notice.
+
 ## [1.16.0] - 2026-09-07
 
 ### Fixed
